flowchart LR
    accTitle: Learn preprocessing on training data
    accDescr: Training data fits the imputer; new data uses that fitted imputer and preserves a missingness flag.
    Train["Training partition"] --> Fit["Fit imputation statistics"]
    New["New observation"] --> Flag["Record missingness flag"]
    New --> Apply["Apply fitted imputer"]
    Fit --> Apply
    Flag --> Features["Model features"]
    Apply --> Features
